&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Currently studying towards a bachelor’s or master’s degree in Computer Science, Maths, Machine Learning, Data Science or a related field&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience with C or C++11, plus familiarity with Python or scripting tools for automation and testing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;An understanding of linear algebra, numerical methods or scientific computing&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Problem-solving skills and collaborative approach to unfamiliar technical challenges&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Previous industry experience is not required. Tell us what you built or investigated through coursework, personal or team projects or other relevant experience, how you approached it and what you learned.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Coursework or experience with machine learning frameworks, parallel programming, code optimisation, maths libraries or performance analysis would be useful. These are additional strengths, rather than essential requirements.&lt;/p&gt;
